1) Zap dobbin with a /oTeleport, then
let him/her find you. There's no luck
penalty for teleporting non-boulders
in Sokoban.

or

2) Work the boulder down the row until
dobbin is standing next to the hole;
sooner or later, dobbin will fail a
saving throw, step through the hole,
and land (probably unharmed), on the
next level. Downside: there is a chance
dobbin will starve before falling through,
so if available, toss the horse a lichen
ration first. Once dobbin is out of the
way and the boulder is in the hole,
retreat back to the next lower level to
retrieve your horse.

3) Back away and be patient, you've
just been unlucky, but you might also
have been in the way. Remember, a pet
that moves faster than you can step
out, bump into you, and step back all
in what you see as one turn. Same issue
with dobbin starving.

